    "summary": "Friendly **IMPERIAL KNIGHTS** models can use their **Bondsman** abilities during your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase). You may choose one or more users. For each use, choose one friendly **ARMIGER** model up to 12″ from the user. The recipient must be free of other **Bondsman** effects. The selected **ARMIGER** gets that effect until your next [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) starts.",
